ey seem to really believe what they say. As an \u00e9trang\u00e8re, players feel both alienated yet strangely comfortable. An RPG-style town filled with fun activities and fascinating people... Our twisting, mysterious story will have you captivated... Make friends, solve mysteries, and become emotionally invested!\n\nWe're sure you'll never be able to forget this town, even though it's in the middle of nowhere!", "summary": "Enjoy everyday life while solving a murder mystery in Rainy Woods - known as the \"happiest town in the world\" - in this all-new \"Debt Repayment RPG\"!", "themes": [{"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-good-life--1", "videos": [{"id": 50271, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "KhvP6QpkDjU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KhvP6QpkDjU", "title": "The Good Life / Indie Live Expo 2021 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KhvP6QpkDjU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 16251, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "1MzVVp-aqUs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1MzVVp-aqUs", "title": "The Good Life PAX WEST Trailer (2017)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1MzVVp-aqUs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 19406, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "mY8RU2nToqk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mY8RU2nToqk", "title": "The Good Life - STROY Trailer - 2018 MAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mY8RU2nToqk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 54944, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "wh4y6GQK0XI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wh4y6GQK0XI", "title": "The Good Life Release Date Announcement Trailer (English)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wh4y6GQK0XI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 16250, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Nscp2KFNHyA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nscp2KFNHyA", "title": "The Good Life  trailer -DOG or CAT-", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Nscp2KFNHyA/hqdefault.jpg"}]}